WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.918 --> 00:00:02.002
[Sharon] My name is Sharon

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:06.340
and I'm an alcoholic with
a splitting headache.

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:07.841
[All] Hi, Sharon.

00:00:10.302 --> 00:00:13.722
[Gabe] My advice? Find
a reason to be here

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:14.806
that's bigger than you are.

00:00:14.806 --> 00:00:16.850
[Sharon] I read about
this family in the paper.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.018
I think this is it.

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:21.313
[Ashley] Dad.

00:00:21.313 --> 00:00:22.773
We have a situation.

00:00:22.773 --> 00:00:24.483
[Michelle] I wanna look
pretty for Mommy!

00:00:24.483 --> 00:00:27.653
[Ed] Well, maybe just little
off the cheeks.

00:00:30.113 --> 00:00:32.032
[Pastor Dave] God is here
with us right now

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:33.492
and we are here with you.

00:00:33.492 --> 00:00:36.453
- Something about that little
girl without a Mama, sick.

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:40.123
And the family's bled dry
from all the hospital bills.

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:42.000
I think I'm supposed to help.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.460
Hi! Sharon.

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:44.294
- Yes, ma'am.

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:46.546
- I just wanted to come
by and give you this.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:48.131
[Barbara] I just made dinner
if you want to stay?

00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:49.841
- Love to.

00:00:49.841 --> 00:00:51.718
- Mom, what are you doing?

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:53.220
I've met this woman.

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:54.346
She's a mess.

00:00:54.346 --> 00:00:56.056
- Perfect, she'll fit right in.

00:00:57.474 --> 00:00:59.559
- $400,000 plus in
medical bills.

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:02.020
All three credit cards
maxed out

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:04.273
And your income's only
$3,600 a month?

00:01:04.273 --> 00:01:05.107
- Yes, ma'am.

00:01:05.107 --> 00:01:06.400
- That's not good, Ed.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:07.818
- No, ma'am.

00:01:07.818 --> 00:01:09.278
- I'm gonna put together
a press kit

00:01:09.278 --> 00:01:11.571
for corporate donations,
that kind of thing.

00:01:12.531 --> 00:01:13.365
Smile!

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:17.244
Girls, help your daddy out!

00:01:17.244 --> 00:01:18.078
- Girls, wait.

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:19.663
(girls giggling)

00:01:19.663 --> 00:01:21.415
- I've owned four
small businesses.

00:01:21.415 --> 00:01:22.791
I'm good at plenty of things.

00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:24.084
taking no for an answer
ain't one of 'em.

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:25.961
[Ashley] Daddy's in
over his head.

00:01:25.961 --> 00:01:27.170
[Virginia] You're asking
us to reduce

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:29.506
the family's medical
bills due to hardship?

00:01:29.506 --> 00:01:31.758
- No, I'm asking you
to erase them.

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:32.759
All of them.

00:01:34.011 --> 00:01:34.928
Was that funny?

00:01:35.804 --> 00:01:37.556
- Daddy!

00:01:37.556 --> 00:01:38.390
My belly hurts.

00:01:39.433 --> 00:01:41.143
- Oh, you wanna go on
an adventure?

00:01:41.143 --> 00:01:42.686
- Mhmm.

00:01:42.686 --> 00:01:45.230
(dramatic music)

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:47.316
[Dr. Ghorbani] Michelle will
need to fly 700 miles

00:01:47.316 --> 00:01:48.525
to the children's hospital.

00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:50.110
- Are you telling me we
need a plane now?

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:53.405
How exactly do you recommend
we get a plane, Doc?

00:01:53.405 --> 00:01:55.115
- I'll get you a plane.
I promise.

00:01:56.575 --> 00:01:58.577
We are going to save
this girl, you hear me?

00:01:58.577 --> 00:02:00.287
- We're gonna need a
lot of shovels.

00:02:03.498 --> 00:02:04.666
This is our last chance!

00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:07.252
If we don't take it,
Michelle dies.

00:02:10.672 --> 00:02:13.008
[Rose] How did it become your
responsibility to save her?

00:02:13.008 --> 00:02:13.842
- 'Cause I'm here.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:16.178
'Cause I can!

00:02:16.178 --> 00:02:19.014
(dramatic music)

